In this section, as in Topologies, Section <a href="/tag/03FE" data-tag="03FE">34.11</a>, we choose our sites $(\mathit{Sch}/S)_\tau $ to have the same underlying category for $\tau \in \{ Zariski, {\acute{e}tale}, smooth, syntomic, fppf\} $. Then also the sites $(\textit{Aff}/S)_\tau $ have the same underlying category.